<p><a href="/autopilot/reviews">← Back to Agent reviews</a></p><h1>Sales after fees, shipping and returns</h1><p>Current lifetime contribution for orders dated <%= start %> to <%= end %>. Posted sales and return credits exclude sales tax. Product cost and returned-goods writeoffs come from the original ledger. Confirm actual net marketplace/processing fees and shipping costs from their statements, including returns and refunds.</p><p>This shows order contribution, not period net profit. Overhead, unmatched expenses and currency conversion need separate review. Shared order costs are allocated to products by original positive sales revenue; currencies stay separate.</p>
<% if(!allowed){ %><p class="notice"><strong>Starter</strong> provides one read-only order suggestion. <strong>Growth / Pro / Custom</strong> can review grouped contribution and import checked cost facts. <a class="btn" href="/billing">Upgrade</a></p><% } %>
<form method="get" action="/autopilot/net-contribution" class="form-stack"><label>Order dates from<input type="date" name="start" required value="<%= start %>"></label><label>Order dates through<input type="date" name="end" required value="<%= end %>"></label><label>Group by<select aria-label="Group by" name="group" <%= allowed?'':'disabled' %>><% [['order','Order'],['item','Item'],['customer','Customer'],['channel','Channel']].forEach(([v,label])=>{ %><option value="<%= v %>" <%= group===v?'selected':'' %>><%= label %></option><% }) %></select></label><button class="btn">Review current contribution</button></form>
<% if(group!=='order'){ %><section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>By <%= group %></h2><% if(!groups.length){ %><p>No matching posted orders.</p><% }else{ %><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th><%= group %></th><th>Orders</th><th>Net sales</th><th>Product cost</th><th>Return writeoffs</th><th>Fees</th><th>Shipping</th><th>Net contribution</th><th>Contribution %</th></tr></thead><tbody><% groups.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><%= r.label %></td><td><%= r.orders %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.revenue,r.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.cogs,r.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.scrap,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.fees==null?'Needs complete costs':helpers.money(r.fees,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.shipping==null?'Needs complete costs':helpers.money(r.shipping,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.net==null?'Not established':helpers.money(r.net,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.net!=null&&r.revenue>0?(100*r.net/r.revenue).toFixed(2)+'%':'Not established' %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% } %></div></section><% } %>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Original orders and cost coverage</h2><% if(!rows.length){ %><p>No posted sales in these order dates.</p><% }else{ %><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Customer</th><th>Channel</th><th>Net sales</th><th>Product cost</th><th>Return writeoffs</th><th>Net contribution</th><th>Contribution %</th><th>Cost coverage</th></tr></thead><tbody><% rows.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><a href="/sales/orders/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.order_number %></a></td><td><%= r.customer_name %></td><td><%= r.channel %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.revenue,r.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.cogs,r.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.scrap,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.net==null?'Not established':helpers.money(r.net,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.net!=null&&r.revenue>0?(100*r.net/r.revenue).toFixed(2)+'%':'Not established' %></td><td><%= r.problem||'Costs confirmed' %><% if(r.costCheckedAt){ %><br>Checked <%= helpers.dateTime(r.costCheckedAt) %><% } %><% if(r.source){ %><br><%= r.source %><% } %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% } %></div></section>
<% if(allowed){ %><section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Import actual cost facts</h2><p>Paste CSV or a six-column table copied from your spreadsheet. Use an exact StockChief order/invoice number or a unique connected-channel order reference. Enter net fees and carrier costs in that order’s currency, excluding recoverable tax. Enter an explicit zero when the original source proves no charge. Include return postage and confirmed fee/carrier refunds; exclude product writeoffs already shown above.</p><p>Columns: <strong>Order, Currency, Channel, Marketplace and processing fees, Shipping including returns, Cost source</strong>.</p><form method="post" action="/autopilot/net-contribution/preview" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Checked cost rows<textarea required name="rows" rows="7" maxlength="1048576" placeholder="Order,Currency,Channel,Marketplace and processing fees,Shipping including returns,Cost source&#10;SO-00001,USD,Website,1.25,4.50,Actual statement reference"></textarea></label><button class="btn btn--primary">Review these cost facts</button></form><p>Up to 500 orders per import. You review the exact amounts before they enter this report. The import records reported costs; it does not post a journal or pay a provider.</p></div></section><% } %>

<% if(pending.length){ %><section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Cost imports waiting for review</h2><ul><% pending.forEach(p=>{ %><li><a href="/autopilot/net-contribution/reviews/<%= p.id %>"><%= p.rows %> order rows · <%= helpers.dateTime(p.created_at) %></a></li><% }) %></ul></div></section><% } %>
